Package: datadriftR
Type: Package
Title: Concept Drift Detection Methods for Stream Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ugur", "Dar", email = "ugurdar@eskisehir.edu.tr", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8076-2199")),
    person("Mustafa", "Cavus", email = "mcavus@eskisehir.edu.tr", 
           role = "aut", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6172-5449"))
  )
Description: Implements several online univariate drift detectors (DDM, EDDM, 
    HDDM-A, HDDM-W, KSWIN, Page-Hinkley, KL-histogram, ProfileDifference) as R6 
    classes with a unified interface for streaming data monitoring. Designed for 
    real-time detection of distributional changes in production machine learning 
    systems and adaptive analytics.
